    "excerpt": "Master Tailor Abdul Ghaffar reveals why luxury Boski kurtas pucker at the placket, cling uncomfortably, and pull across the shoulders—plus how to tailor a Jamawar waistcoat with razor-clean collar balance.",
    "date": "2026-11-12",
