    "coverImage": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1610030469983-98e550d6193c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=80",
    "content": "# Crafting Your Dream Bridal Outfit From Overseas\n\nCommissioning your Baraat, Walima, or Mehndi ensemble from London, Toronto, Houston, New York, Dubai, or Sydney no longer requires frantic transatlantic flights or guessing bust and waist numbers on generic charts. Overseen personally by **Master Tailor Abdul Ghaffar** at our atelier at **Shop F-9, Moon Tower, Block 30-M, International Market, Model Town, Lahore, Pakistan**, SARTOR combines generational Pakistani hand-embroidery with engineering-grade remote fitting safeguards.\n\nIn this guide, you'll learn:\n* Realistic commissioning timelines from Lahore's wooden embroidery frames (*addas*) to your doorstep abroad\n* How pure Katan raw silk, French tissue, and crinkle chiffon compare for structured vs. fluid bridal silhouettes\n* How SARTOR's 4-step milestone payment framework protects overseas brides\n* Essential technical safeguards including 2.5-inch internal seam allowances and 3-tier canvas waistband suspension\n\n---\n\n> **Quick Answer:** Overseas brides can commission bespoke Pakistani bridalwear reliably from Lahore by booking 10 to 16 weeks in advance, completing a 1-on-1 guided video measurement consultation logged in [app.sartor.pk](https://app.sartor.pk), approving a live 4K wooden *adda* swatch video before cutting, and insisting on 2.5-inch internal seam margins plus 3–5 day insured DHL Express transit compliant with $800 US and £135 UK customs thresholds.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Transparent Atelier Timelines, Fabrics & Currency Estimates\n\nHand-embroidery (*zardozi*, *kora*, *dabka*, and *marori*) on high-density bridal lehengas requires hundreds of focused *karigar* hours before pattern assembly begins:\n\n| Bridal Silhouette | Recommended Fabric Base (GSM) | Handwork Turnaround | Express Stitching Only | Estimated Range (USD / GBP / AED) |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Baraat Zardozi Lehenga** | 100–120 GSM Pure Katan Raw Silk | 10–14 Weeks | 10–14 Business Days | $2,200–$4,500 / £1,750–£3,600 / 8,000–16,500 AED |\n| **Walima Farshi Gharara / Gown** | 80 GSM Silk or French Metallic Tissue | 8–10 Weeks | 8–12 Business Days | $1,400–$2,800 / £1,100–£2,200 / 5,100–10,200 AED |\n| **Mehndi / Shendi Kalidar** | 80 GSM Khaddi Georgette / Chiffon | 6–8 Weeks | 7–10 Business Days | $750–$1,600 / £600–£1,280 / 2,750–5,800 AED |\n| **Trousseau / Unstitched Brand Suit** | Brand Lawn, Raw Silk, Organza | N/A | 5–7 Business Days | $38–$95 / £30–£75 / 140–350 AED (Stitching) |\n\nWe dispatch finished garments via insured **DHL Express or FedEx International Priority** (3–5 business days to the UK, USA, and Canada; 2–3 days to Dubai and Abu Dhabi), accompanied by properly itemized export documentation aligned with **$800 US** and **£135 UK** customs rules.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Structural Tailoring Safeguards Built for Diaspora Brides\n\nEvery bridal garment drafted at Shop F-9, Moon Tower, Model Town, Lahore includes non-negotiable architectural engineering:\n1. **3-Tier Canvas Waistband Suspension:** Disperses 6–10 kg of bridal lehenga skirt mass across the pelvic iliac crest rather than bruising the waist with thin drawstrings.\n2. **Ergonomic Scye Depth Balance:** Deepens front-to-back armhole curvature by 1.25–1.5 inches so sleeves raise freely during *Rukhsati* embraces without lifting the choli hem.\n3. **1.5 to 2.5-Inch Internal Seam Margins:** Every side seam and sleeve opening incorporates generous silk-bound alteration allowances so any neighborhood tailor in London, Toronto, or Houston can adjust sizing by up to two dress sizes without cutting embroidery.\n4. **4-Step Milestone Transparency:** 10% booking token, 30% upon 4K daylight *adda* swatch approval, 30% mid-production panel check, and 30% final dispatch sign-off on mannequin video.\n\n---\n\n## Customer Preparation Checklist Before Your Sizing Call\n\n☐ Log your pre-beta measurement profile at **[app.sartor.pk](https://app.sartor.pk)** ahead of your video consultation.  \n☐ Have your actual bridal block heels or *khussas* ready to measure exact floor-to-waistband drop.  \n☐ Prepare a non-stretch vinyl measuring tape in inches and a family helper to hold the tape level.  \n☐ Share jewelry photos so Master Tailor Abdul Ghaffar can balance antique *kora* vs. bright *dabka* alloys and neckline depth.  \n\n---\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions\n\n### How does SARTOR guarantee a bridal lehenga fits without flying to Lahore?\nMaster Tailor Abdul Ghaffar conducts a live 28-point biometric video measurement session over WhatsApp while storing every coordinate inside our digital measurement portal at [app.sartor.pk](https://app.sartor.pk). Combined with 1.5–2.5 inch internal seam allowances, garments arrive fitted to millimeter tolerances while remaining easily adjustable locally if needed.\n\n### How does the 4-step milestone payment schedule protect overseas brides?\nInstead of paying 100% upfront, overseas clients release funds in four verified checkpoints: 10% token booking, 30% upon approving an actual 8x8-inch hand-embroidered *adda* swatch on 4K daylight video, 30% at mid-production basting inspection, and the final 30% only when the finished outfit passes studio mannequin inspection prior to DHL dispatch.\n\n### How fast is insured international bridal delivery from Lahore to the UK, USA, Canada, and UAE?\nOnce dispatched from our Model Town, Lahore atelier, insured DHL Express and FedEx Priority shipments arrive in 3–5 business days across the UK, USA, and Canada, and 2–3 business days across the UAE, packed in acid-free archival boxes with de minimis documentation ($800 US / £135 UK).\n\n### Can I order custom stitching only if I already bought an unstitched designer bridal or formal suit?\nYes. Overseas clients routinely ship unstitched ensembles from Maria.B, Elan, Suffuse, or Sana Safinaz directly to Shop F-9, Moon Tower, Model Town, Lahore for precision cutting, pure Habotai silk lining installation, and consolidated express dispatch.\n\n---\n\n## Ready to Begin Your Bridal Commission?\n\nExplore our bespoke bridal engineering at **[sartor.pk](https://sartor.pk)**, log your measurements in our pre-beta portal at **[app.sartor.pk](https://app.sartor.pk)**, or message Master Tailor Abdul Ghaffar directly on WhatsApp at **[wa.me/923320500904](https://wa.me/923320500904)** (`+92 332 0500904`)."
