    "title": "How Overseas Brides Can Safely Order Custom Pakistani Bridalwear Online (Without Flight Tickets or Fitting Disasters)",
    "excerpt": "The authoritative guide for overseas Pakistani brides in the UK, USA, Canada, UAE, and Australia on commissioning custom bridal couture from Lahore without transatlantic flights, sizing risks, or fabric substitutions.",
