    "title": "The Bespoke Velvet Shawl & Bridal Chaddar Guide: Hand-Draped Zardozi Borders, Micro-Velvet 9000 vs. Silk Velvet, and Zero-Slip Shoulder Rigging",
    "excerpt": "Master the architecture of heirloom Pakistani velvet shawls. Learn how Micro-Velvet 9000, hand-couched zardozi borders, and zero-slip shoulder rigging prevent sliding.",
    "date": "2026-10-30",
