    "excerpt": "Master the vibrant craft of Pakistani Mehndi & Mayun kalidars. Decode authentic hand-beaten silver/gold gota patti, jewel-toned chatapati patchwork, and 360-degree twirl physics for high-energy Sangeet dances.",
